Report `infiniband.port_rcv_data` and `infiniband.port_xmit_data` in bytes rather than the raw sysfs value, which IBTA defines in units of 4-byte words, so the values for these two metrics increase fourfold and any monitor or dashboard using a static threshold on them must be rescaled; the `port_state` and `port_phys_state` tag values are now normalized, which changes the emitted value for any state whose kernel name contains a space or angle brackets.
